::sig score_targets(targets: list[Unit], corpus: list[Unit], top: int=3) -> list[dict]
::doc Score each target unit against the corpus. Returns one report dict per unit.
::algo cfg==,=,=,for{call,for{=}},for{=,=,=,if{call,call,cnt},=,=,for{if{cnt},if{cnt},call},call,=,=,=,=,=,=,=,=,for{=,=,if{call,call},if{brk}},=,=,=,for{if{cnt},=,=,=,=,=,=,=,if{=|if{=,=|if{=}}},=,if{=,if{=}},if{=},call},call,call},ret an=*:2,+:4,-:3,/:2,==:7,>=:12,algo:6,algo_similarity:2,and:12,append:6,end:6,fp:7,id:3,is-not:3,len:3,lits:5,max:3,norm:7,not:3,or:7,path:8,qualname:4,round:9,start:8
